{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2022-09-29 13:42:00', 'title': 'GARMIN ANNOUNCES 2022 GARMIN HEALTH AWARDS WINNERS', 'text': 'ROME--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GARMIN INTERNATIONAL, INC., A UNIT OF GARMIN LTD. (NYSE: GRMN), TODAY ANNOUNCED WINNERS OF THE 2022 GARMIN HEALTH AWARDS AT THE 4TH ANNUAL GARMIN HEALTH SUMMIT HELD IN ROME ON SEPT. 29-30. THE EVENT RECOGNIZES CUTTING-EDGE HEALTH CARE AND WELLNESS SOLUTIONS THAT SUCCESSFULLY LEVERAGE GARMIN TECHNOLOGY TO PROVIDE LONG-TERM BENEFITS AND IMPROVE OUTCOMES FOR BUSINESSES, PATIENTS AND POPULATION HEALTH. THREE AWARDS FOR MOST INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS WERE GRANTED IN THE CATEGORIES'}